              "text": "**wakehealth.edu** is the official website for **Atrium Health Wake Forest Baptist**, a prominent, fully integrated academic medical center and health system based in Winston-Salem, North Carolina. \n\nThe system is affiliated with the **Wake Forest University School of Medicine** and is a part of **Advocate Health**, one of the largest non-profit health systems in the United States.\n\n### What You Can Find on wakehealth.edu:\n\n* **MyAtriumHealth Patient Portal:** Patients can log in to schedule appointments, message their doctors, view test results, and pay medical bills. *(Note: Atrium Health Wake Forest Baptist transitioned its legacy \"myWakeHealth\" portal to the unified MyAtriumHealth portal).*\n* **Find a Doctor:** A searchable directory of primary care physicians, specialists, and advanced practice providers across North Carolina.\n* **Medical Services:** Information about specialized care, including the NCI-designated Comprehensive Cancer Center, Brenner Children\u2019s Hospital, heart and vascular care, orthopedics, neurology, and more.\n* **Locations:** Directions, contact numbers, and hours for their hospitals, urgent care centers, emergency departments, and outpatient clinics.\n* **Academics & Research:** Direct portals to the Wake Forest University School of Medicine, which manages medical education, residency programs, fellowships, and clinical trials.\n\n***\n\n**How can I help you today?** \nIf you are looking for something specific, let me know! I can help you find:\n* Contact phone numbers for specific clinics or customer service.\n* Direct links to sign up for or log into the patient portal.\n* Information on how to schedule an appointment. \n* Directions to one of their major hospital locations.",
